id: pm-vcs-17li
title: Refresh dependencies and regenerate self-host bundle to unblock Dependabot PRs
description: "Dependabot PRs #28, #29, #30 are permanently unmergeable because the accept:self-host gate rejects any lockfile change without a regenerated selfhost.bundle. Land the three dependency updates in one commit, regenerate the bundle, add a weekly dependency-refresh workflow, and document the bundle coupling in AGENTS.md."
